<title>USA: Performance Food Group Co Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Performance Food Group Co Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PERFORMANCE FOOD GROUP COMPANY</p>
<p>		   Unaudited Financial Highlights</p>
<p>						   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					   September 28, September 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales			     $202,401,000    $169,481,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			     3,159,000	 2,292,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share(a)		   0.26		0.23</p>
<p>Average number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding(a)			 12,083,000	 9,763,000</p>
